{"id":"267957a097ff75bf","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-metric.md","title":"Metric","display":"df-metric — Metric","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-metric","aliases":["58-df-metric","Metric","Distance Function"],"display":"df-metric — Metric","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-metric"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-metric</span><span>Metric</span><span>Distance Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-metric — Metric"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,X,x,y,z\\in V\">\\(d,X,x,y,z\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric} \\vdash \\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(d,X\\times X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land \\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\bigl(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=0\\leftrightarrow x=y\\bigr)\\land d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=d(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\\\&amp;\\land d(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\leq d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)+d(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric} \\vdash \\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(d,X\\times X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land \\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\bigl(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=0\\leftrightarrow x=y\\bigr)\\land d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=d(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\\\&amp;\\land d(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\leq d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)+d(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Metric: nonnegative symmetric function satisfying triangle and identity</li>\n<li>函数按上游的集合图约定作用于有序对；因此二元距离不再写成未经声明的元层函数类型。</li>\n<li>Examples: Euclidean <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(x,y) = \\|x-y\\|\">\\(d(x,y) = \\|x-y\\|\\)</span>, discrete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(x,y) = 0\">\\(d(x,y) = 0\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span></li>\n<li>Ultrametric: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(x,z) \\leq \\max(d(x,y), d(y,z))\">\\(d(x,z) \\leq \\max(d(x,y), d(y,z))\\)</span></li>\n<li>Pseudometric: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(x,y) = 0\">\\(d(x,y) = 0\\)</span> allowed for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\neq y\">\\(x \\neq y\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d,X,x,y,z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric} \\vdash \\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(d,X\\times X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land \\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&\\bigl(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=0\\leftrightarrow x=y\\bigr)\\land d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=d(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\\\&\\land d(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\leq d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)+d(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"d(x,y) = \\|x-y\\|","display":false},{"tex":"d(x,y) = 0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"d(x,z) \\leq \\max(d(x,y), d(y,z))","display":false},{"tex":"d(x,y) = 0","display":false},{"tex":"x \\neq y","display":false}],"bytes":1273,"backlinks":[{"id":"4acab55d1a2da070","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S$ (metric predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]])"},{"id":"0cd6f9d4f0451efa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-metric]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])"},{"id":"4f429cabb0431a2d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-metric]])"},{"id":"65b5a378dcf758ab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)$ is the metric predicate (see [[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]])"},{"id":"2c2c52f227661657","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S$ (metric predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]])"},{"id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2$（度量谓词，见 [[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]]）"},{"id":"ed30f132c1f52e7a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(X,d_X)$ and $(Y,d_Y)$ (metric spaces, see [[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]])"},{"id":"d2da02a4771afce5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-metric]])"},{"id":"6ced3a4cc9f8e397","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (metric predicate, see [[58-df-metric]])"},{"id":"e580c19f3796935d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (metric predicate, see [[58-df-metric]])"},{"id":"d1d6caf42abe4955","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S$ (see [[58-df-metric]])"},{"id":"6912e28e7e9282d2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-metric]])"},{"id":"0d02dcc69684a5ea","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"705c3caaeb653647","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c27f87e6422a971f","anchor":"ref-1"